    {
      "id": "claim_d5a691f627924cd6b5f5f8c159427f1a",
      "statement": "Building the root bus is lazy: the first framework(dto) call calls build_root_bus() when was_initialized is False, yet a service that also serves a transport should build eagerly at startup because building a bus is what installs the process tracer provider its ASGI middleware needs.",
