    {
      "id": "claim_638184d6018046f69d5e600ae31f31dc",
      "statement": "An ApplicationService is constructed with the container's FeatureBus, which is the same FeatureBus object the framework facade holds, so self.feature_bus delegation runs through the atomic layer; a Feature is not handed any bus.",
