    {
      "id": "claim_d0de4b9cf94f4801ad9da66590d12145",
      "statement": "The return_type argument of framework(dto, return_type) is a static-typing device only: the pipeline forwards it to an executor that never uses it, so it narrows the IDE's view of the result and changes no runtime behaviour.",
