      "id": "claim_e0f58226389144afb49db5cc2ddd1d64",
      "statement": "Execution routes by input DTO class name into exactly one layer: a name in neither registry raises UnknownDTOToExecute, a name present in both feature_registry and app_service_registry raises DTOAlreadyRegistered, and the cross-layer collision is checked both when the FrameworkBus is built and again on every call.",
